WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-US

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:01.680
Collaboration,

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:03.200
Communication, and

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.600
Coordination

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.320
key to better project management

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:08.000
with clients and team.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.080
Thanks to FluentBoards'

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:09.960
Frontend Portal

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:11.600
for making these achievable

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:13.640
more easily than ever.

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:14.920
It allows anyone to access

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:16.280
project boards directly

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:17.520
from the front end,

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:18.440
without revealing

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:20.200
backend operations.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:20.960
Let’s deal with

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:22.880
clients and team collaboration first

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:24.800
to get this done.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:25.720
You can add them

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:26.600
if they are already

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:28.120
on your WordPress site,

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:29.600
or invite them easily

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:31.280
using their email.

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:32.920
No matter where they are,

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:36.600
an onboarding link will be sent in seconds!

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.640
Next, manage members' roles

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:39.400
from the settings

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:42.840
to control what they can access.

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:43.520
Alright,

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:47.200
let’s take a look at the features and modules!

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:48.640
Spot the Frontend portal

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:51.120
and enable it from the settings.

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:52.240
Right after that,

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:53.600
you will get the flexibility

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:55.080
to showcase your portal

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:58.560
either via shortcode or a dedicated page.

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:00.440
I’ll choose a standalone URL

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:02.400
because of its simplicity.

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:05.200
Provide a URL slug as suggested,

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:07.520
and save the changes.

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:10.040
In case you already have a page,

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:11.480
simply select it

00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:14.080
and add the shortcode in it.

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:15.120
These easy tasks

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:17.280
wrap up the setup process.

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:18.640
Now, let's see how it works

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:20.040
on the front end.

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:21.080
For that,

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:23.320
click the dedicated frontend portal button

00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:26.160
or the arrow. Voila!

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:28.040
The sidebar disappears,

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:31.440
while everything else stays the same.

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:35.160
No backend access, no privacy concerns.

00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:36.320
But what happens

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:38.680
when your clients get this link?

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:40.560
Let’s take a look of that as well.

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:41.640
All it takes to provide

00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:43.240
the right credentials

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:46.480
and they are on the project board.

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:47.720
And that's how

00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:49.080
FluentBoards not only makes

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:50.880
project management better

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:52.920
but also enhances engagement

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:54.720
in every stage.

00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:56.440
So why wait?

00:01:56.440 --> 00:01:57.720
Grab FluentBoards now

00:01:57.720 --> 00:02:00.720
and manage any project better collaboratively

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:03.000
with clients and team members.

